ow what became of them,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_34","text":"I kept thinking about them anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_35","text":"I'm really glad you came to the Outer Rim with me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_36","text":"If I'd gone by myself, I probably would've overthought everything","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_37","text":"and eventually just turned around and come back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_38","text":"I was able to be brave because I had you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_visioneye_05_39","text":"If you ever want to go to the Outer Rim again, just say the word.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"b